kchain sovereign commerce connecting African producers of minerals, agricultural goods, textiles, and cultural products to verified global markets through OmniGaza®. African Rare Earth Mineral Fund© governing blockchain provenance from mine to market. Launching Q3 2026. The Ndege Foundation©: Social and physical infrastructure through a Development Finance Fund© and continental REIT. Conservation, healthcare, renewable energy, and the Daudi Mutuku Fund for Education© advancing 2,500+ scholar11-50ke
